Playing the random genetic lottery with children's genes "affirms their
autonomy"?
Disallowing inferior genes "sets limits" on children? The blind
hackscrabble of Nature is superior to the caring, conscious hand of a
parent?

>Would I get to label my kid 'defective' if he/she became
